.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.PP
.nf
Implementation of the Metadata for Python packages PEPs\&.

Supports all metadata formats (1\&.0, 1\&.1, 1\&.2, 1\&.3/2\&.1 and 2\&.2)\&.

.fi
.PP
 
